{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测Windows疑似伪造验证码钓鱼。对应需求：执行。官方：Potential Fake CAPTCHA Phishing Attack。","from":"now-9m","index":["logs-endpoint.events.process-*","logs-crowdstrike.fdr*","logs-m365_defender.event-*","logs-sentinel_one_cloud_funnel.*","logs-system.security*","logs-windows.forwarded*","logs-windows.sysmon_operational-*","winlogbeat-*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Windows疑似伪造验证码钓鱼","risk_score":73,"rule_id":"fbad57ec-4442-48db-a34f-5ee907b44a22","severity":"high","tags":["操作系统: Windows","主题: 执行","来源: 默认","对应需求: 执行"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"process where host.os.type == \"windows\" and event.type == \"start\" and\n process.name : (\"powershell.exe\", \"cmd.exe\", \"mshta.exe\") and process.parent.name : \"explorer.exe\" and\n process.command_line : (\"*recaptcha *\", \"*CAPTCHA Verif*\", \"*complete verification*\", \"*Verification ID*\", \"*Verification Code*\", \"*Verification UID*\",\n                         \"*hυmаn vаlіdаtiοn*\", \"*human ID*\", \"*Action Identificator*\", \"*not a robot*\", \"*Click OK to*\", \"*anti-robot test*\",\n                         \"*Cloudflare ID*\")\n","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nWindows疑似伪造验证码钓鱼\n\n### 为何重要\n在主机上执行命令或脚本\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 Windows 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件/注册表或安全日志）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","event.action","event.code","file.path","registry.path","source.ip","destination.ip","message"]},"threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1059","name":"Command and Scripting Interpreter","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1059.001","name":"PowerShell","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/001/"},{"id":"T1059.003","name":"Windows Command Shell","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/003/"}]},{"id":"T1204","name":"User Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1204/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1204.004","name":"Malicious Copy and Paste","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1204/004/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0002","name":"Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0002/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1218","name":"System Binary Proxy Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1218/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1218.005","name":"Mshta","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1218/005/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0005","name":"Defense Evasion","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0005/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1189","name":"Drive-by Compromise","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1189/"},{"id":"T1566","name":"Phishing","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1566/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1566.001","name":"Spearphishing Attachment","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1566/001/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0001","name":"Initial Access","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0001/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"},{"package":"windows","version":"*"},{"package":"system","version":"*"},{"package":"sentinel_one_cloud_funnel","version":"*"},{"package":"m365_defender","version":"*"},{"package":"crowdstrike","version":"*"}],"version":5,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":